### Arsitektur yang dibutuhkan:

```
User WhatsApp
     │
     │ (kirim pesan)
     ▼
┌─────────────┐    webhook     ┌─────────────────┐    API call    ┌──────────────┐
│   OpenWA    │ ─────────────► │  Backend Kamu   │ ─────────────► │  LLM (AI)    │
│  (Gateway)  │                │ (Node/Python/   │                │ (OpenAI,     │
│             │ ◄───────────── │  dll)           │ ◄───────────── │  Gemini, dst)│
└─────────────┘  send message  └─────────────────┘   AI response  └──────────────┘
     │
     │ (balas pesan)
     ▼
User WhatsApp
```

---

### Cara implementasinya:

**Step 1 — Setup Webhook di OpenWA**
```bash
# Daftarkan webhook ke URL backend kamu
curl -X POST http://localhost:2785/api/sessions/{sessionId}/webhooks \
  -H "X-API-Key: dev-admin-key" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "url": "http://backend-kamu.com/webhook",
    "events": ["message.received"]
  }'
```

**Step 2 — Backend kamu menerima pesan (contoh Node.js)**
```javascript
app.post('/webhook', async (req, res) => {
  const { event, data } = req.body;

  if (event === 'message.received' && !data.fromMe) {
    const userMessage = data.body;
    const chatId = data.chatId;

    // Kirim ke LLM
    const aiResponse = await callLLM(userMessage);

    // Balas lewat OpenWA API
    await fetch(`http://localhost:2785/api/sessions/{sessionId}/messages/send-text`, {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: {
        'X-API-Key': 'dev-admin-key',
        'Content-Type': 'application/json'
      },
      body: JSON.stringify({ chatId, text: aiResponse })
    });
  }

  res.json({ ok: true });
});
```

**Step 3 — Integrasi LLM (contoh OpenAI)**
```javascript
async function callLLM(userMessage) {
  const response = await openai.chat.completions.create({
    model: 'gpt-4',
    messages: [
      {
        role: 'system',
        content: 'Kamu adalah customer support toko X. Jawab dengan ramah dan profesional.'
      },
      { role: 'user', content: userMessage }
    ]
  });

  return response.choices[0].message.content;
}
```

